							Guild Charter
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We are here to preserve the Secret Fire of Norrath. To help us do that we will preserve the history of Norrath and help to create a newer and better one for adventurers in the future.<br />
some policies<br />
A: As guild policy you do not need to leave a group to help a guild member, that is personal choice. <br />
B: There will not be any guild dues until a 2/3rds majority votes to install one (not for a long while at least) <br />
C: Raids will be free of participation payments until further notice. (same as dues approx) <br />
D: As a guild we do not actively powerlevel members, if someone in the guild wants to powerlevel someone then it is their choice and not required of them. <br />
E: The lowest level someone can be invited into the guild is lv 15. <br />
F: To invite someone you must have grouped with them, determined they are a decent group player, and then run a background check with people on to make sure nobody has any objections. <br />
G: And lastly as guild policy we frown on ninja looting and to do so and have someone in our guild hear about it is to risk getting kicked out. <br />
Hope more people can make the next meeting.						</td>
